# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The patterns below are deliberately not anchored to the repository root,
# because the project itself lives one folder down in CSC584-Uni-Run. Leaving
# the leading slash on would stop them matching anything.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output
# Regenerated by Clean and Build, so it does not belong in version control.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
build/
dist/

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NetBeans settings that are specific to one machine
# These hold absolute paths to the local Tomcat and NetBeans installation, so
# they would be wrong on anybody else's computer. NetBeans recreates them the
# first time the project is opened.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
nbproject/private/

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local database backups
# May contain real account data, so they are kept off the repository.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
backup_*.sql

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Uploaded proof images
# These are written beside the running Tomcat instance rather than inside the
# project, but this keeps any stray local folder out of the repository.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
web/uploads/

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor and operating system noise
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*~
*.swp
*.log
